    "imageURL": "MisticoCMLL.webp",
    "division": "Men's",
    "bio":"Initially working as Místico, he later signed with WWE, where he was known under the name Sin Cara (Spanish for 'Without Face' or 'Faceless'). Upon his return to Mexico, he worked under the name Myzteziz in AAA, before settling on the ring name Carístico upon returning to CMLL in 2015. In 2021, he regained the Místico name, due to his successor and tag team partner Místico II leaving CMLL."
